---

The application relies on the following third-party data and services, each
under its own terms. Bundled data files are redistributed here under the
licenses noted; live services are queried at runtime and are not redistributed.

- Aircraft ADS-B positions: adsb.lol and adsb.fi community feeder networks.
  Data licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL).
  https://adsb.lol/  ·  https://adsb.fi/

- Aircraft registration database (src-tauri/assets/aircraft.csv.gz): the
  Mictronics database, distributed via wiedehopf/tar1090-db.
  Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-BY).
  https://www.mictronics.de/aircraft-database/
  https://github.com/wiedehopf/tar1090-db

- Airport data (src-tauri/assets/airports.csv, runways.csv,
  airport-frequencies.csv): OurAirports. Public domain.
  https://ourairports.com/data/

- Airline callsign / telephony data (src-tauri/assets/airlines.dat): OpenFlights.
  Open Database License (ODbL). https://openflights.org/data.html

- Aircraft type designators — engine and wake-turbulence data
  (src-tauri/assets/actypes.json): Mictronics types.json, distributed via
  Mictronics/readsb. https://www.mictronics.de/

- Route lookups: hexdb.io. https://hexdb.io/

- Aircraft photography: planespotters.net API (photographer-attributed) and
  Wikipedia / Wikimedia Commons page images (representative model photos).

- Basemap: CARTO and OpenFreeMap vector styles, data (c) OpenStreetMap
  contributors. https://carto.com/attributions  ·  https://openfreemap.org/

- Geocoding (home location search): Photon by Komoot, data (c) OpenStreetMap
  contributors. https://photon.komoot.io/

- User-interface icons (src/lib/ui/Icon.svelte): path geometry from Lucide
  (https://lucide.dev), ISC License. Copyright (c) for portions of this code are
  held by Lucide Contributors 2022. Lucide is a fork of Feather (MIT, Copyright
  (c) 2013-2017 Cole Bemis).
